  "term": "methysergide",
  "definition": "Methysergide is an ergot-derived drug related to lysergic acid diethylamide that blocks serotonin’s effects in blood vessels and gastrointestinal smooth muscle. It has been used to help prevent migraine and other vascular headaches and to counter serotonin effects in carcinoid syndrome.",
